"P1507501059" "Excellent, excellent. And in record time! I'll just pop these into the lab, and in no time at all, I'll have a brand new Smythe 032 ready for you. What's a Smythe 032? Well, I'm glad to see you're interested. It uses the hydraulic system of your heart to pump a tightly controlled adrenaline stream through your body. Quite safely, I assure you. The patent is pending even as we speak. I'll send it over to the City Representative when it's ready."

